ery Handler 內部運作。","locale":"zh-TW"},"35":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**FHIR 驗證器**\\\n使用內建或外部驗證工具對輸入之 FHIR 資源進行結構與規範校驗。","locale":"zh-TW"},"36":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#預覽下一代架構","content":"如果您正在規劃系統升級或希望體驗次世代功能，歡迎瀏覽 &#x2A;*Burni v3 (Preview)** 文件，搶先了解 Express 5、雙資料庫時序資料儲存（Temporal Migration）及增強型 FHIR 系統參數等全新突破！","locale":"zh-TW"},"37":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"page","content":"介紹","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","locale":"zh-TW"},"38":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni FHIR Server","locale":"zh-TW"},"39":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Server 能力聲明","locale":"zh-TW"},"40":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 使用 Node.JS 、Express 框架以及 MongoDB 實作 FHIR R4 Server，經由簡單的設定即可產生指定 FHIR Resource的 Mongoose Schema、API程式碼並可自行更改，滿足需求。目前Burni支援Windows以及Linux，讓開發人員可以快速架設 FHIR Server。","locale":"zh-TW"},"41":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 所使用的 FHIR 版本為 v4.0.1。","locale":"zh-TW"},"42":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Burni 使用 AEGIS Touchstone Basic-R4-Server 測試.","locale":"zh-TW"},"43":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"測試結果:","locale":"zh-TW"},"44":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 18 (2,216 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"45":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 14 (1,948 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"46":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"page","content":"Burni v3 概覽 (Preview)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v3 (Preview)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","locale":"zh-TW"},"47":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","content":"Burni v3 次世代架構與全新特性亮點","locale":"zh-TW"},"48":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#burni-v3-preview-全新特性概覽","content":"Burni v3 (Preview) 全新特性概覽","locale":"zh-TW"},"49":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-核心革新亮點","content":"🌟 核心革新亮點","locale":"zh-TW"},"50":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"1\\. 核心技術棧升級","locale":"zh-TW"},"51":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"2\\. 雙資料庫與時序架構（Dual Database & Temporal Architecture）","locale":"zh-TW"},"52":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"3\\. 增強的 FHIR 系統層級搜尋參數（System Search Parameters）","locale":"zh-TW"},"53":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"4\\. 品質保證與現代化工程標準","locale":"zh-TW"},"54":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"📚 章節閱讀導覽","locale":"zh-TW"},"55":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#burni-v3-preview-全新特性概覽","content":"**Burni v3** 是 Burni FHIR Server 的重大里程碑升級。在繼承 v2 優良的 FHIR R4 合規性與高穩定性的基礎上，v3 全面革新了核心底層架構，針對現代化雲端原生環境、大規模醫療資料儲存以及高效能檢索需求進行了深度重構。","locale":"zh-TW"},"56":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Node.js >= 22 (LTS)**：充分利用現代 JavaScript 語言特性與 V8 引擎的高效能表現。","locale":"zh-TW"},"57":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Express 5 (5.2.1)**：核心框架升級至 Express 5，改善非同步路由錯誤處理（Promise rejection handling）、更安全的 Query Parser，提升 HTTP 處理效率。","locale":"zh-TW"},"58":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Mongoose 8 (8.24+)**：升級至最新世代的 MongoDB ODM，提供更強大的 TypeScript 型別支援與更高效的連線池管理。","locale":"zh-TW"},"59":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**fhir-tool 5.0.2**：取代舊版 fhir 套件，採用更輕量且針對 R4 規格高度優化的解析與驗證工具。","locale":"zh-TW"},"60":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"在醫療臨床應用中，FHIR 資源的每一次更新（Update）與刪除（Delete）都必須保留完整的歷史版本與操作記錄（Provenance / History）。然而，將大量的歷史時序資料與目前有效資源（Active Resources）混存於同一個資料庫集合中，會嚴重影響日常查詢效能。","locale":"zh-TW"},"61":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"v3 引入了全新的**雙資料庫拓撲架構**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"62":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**主要資料庫 (Primary DB)**：專注儲存當前有效的 Active FHIR 資源，索引緊湊、查詢與搜尋極速。","locale":"zh-TW"},"63":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**時序歷史資料庫 (Temporal DB)**：專門負責持久化歷史版本（`_history`）、vread 操作與審計 Provenance 資料。","locale":"zh-TW"},"64":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**串流遷移與預檢機制**：提供 `temporal:preflight` 與 `temporal:migrate` 命令，支援平滑漸進式搬遷與資料完整性驗證。","locale":"zh-TW"},"65":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"v3 針對 FHIR 標準定義的系統全域參數進行了全面實作與底層優化：","locale":"zh-TW"},"66":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_tag`**：支援依據 Coding（系統代碼/值）精準與多條件過濾資源。","locale":"zh-TW"},"67":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_security`**：提供針對機密等級（Security Labels）的快速權限與合規過濾。","locale":"zh-TW"},"68":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_profile`**：支援依據 StructureDefinition Canonical URI 檢索符合特定 Profile 的資源。","locale":"zh-TW"},"69":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**完整日期與時區精度**：修正 date / dateTime 查詢在跨時區與不同精度（年、月、日、分、秒、毫秒）下的查詢邊界，完全符合 HL7 FHIR 規範。","locale":"zh-TW"},"70":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**全資源 CRUD 整合測試門禁（`npm run test:all-resource-crud`）**：涵蓋 FHIR R4 Catalog 全部 146 項資源的自動化 Create / Read / History 驗證。","locale":"zh-TW"},"71":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**診斷 CI 閘門（Diagnostics Gate）**：自動化驗證所有搜尋參數的型別定義與執行路徑。","locale":"zh-TW"},"72":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**Mocha 12 + Chai 6 + ESLint 10 Flat Config**：全面導入現代化測試與代碼規範體系。","locale":"zh-TW"},"73":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-26","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**介紹**：了解 Burni v3 核心特點與 AEGIS Touchstone Conformance 測試能力聲明。","locale":"zh-TW"},"74":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-27","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**讓我們開始吧！**：快速開始指南，包含安裝、設定（`config/config.js` 與 `.env`）與伺服器部署。","locale":"zh-TW"},"75":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-28","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**v2 到 v3 遷移指南預覽**：包含升級前提條件、環境變數調整與資料庫遷移步驟。","locale":"zh-TW"},"76":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-29","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**時序與雙資料庫架構解析**：深入了解主資料庫與時序資料庫的協同運作機制與拓撲設計。","locale":"zh-TW"},"77":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-30","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**FHIR 系統搜尋參數指南**：掌握 `_tag`、`_profile`、`_security` 與日期精度的搜尋用法。","locale":"zh-TW"},"78":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","type":"page","content":"介紹","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v3 (Preview)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","locale":"zh-TW"},"79":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","content":"Burni v3 FHIR Server 介紹與能力聲明","locale":"zh-TW"},"80":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#介紹","content":"介紹","locale":"zh-TW"},"81":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni FHIR Server","locale":"zh-TW"},"82":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Server 能力聲明","locale":"zh-TW"},"83":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 使用 Node.js、Express 框架以及 MongoDB 實作 HL7® FHIR® R4 Server，經由簡單的設定即可產生指定 FHIR Resource 的 Mongoose Schema 與 API 程式碼，並可自由擴充與客製化以滿足臨床與業務需求。目前 Burni 完整支援 Windows 與 Linux 環境，讓醫療資訊工程人員能快速架設高效能、符合規範的 FHIR Server。","locale":"zh-TW"},"84":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 所使用的 FHIR 版本為 &#x2A;*v4.0.1 (R4)**。","locale":"zh-TW"},"85":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"在 **v3** 版本中，核心技術棧與底層架構進行了全面現代化升級：","locale":"zh-TW"},"86":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**Node.js >= 22 (LTS)** 與 **Express 5**，提供更優異的非同步錯誤處理與高並發吞吐量。","locale":"zh-TW"},"87":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**Mongoose 8**，提供強健的 ODM 連線管理與現代化驅動支援。","locale":"zh-TW"},"88":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**雙資料庫與時序架構（Dual Database & Temporal Architecture）**，將即時資源與歷史版本/審計（Provenance）分離持久化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"89":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**系統層級搜尋參數**，原生支援 `_tag`、`_security`、`_profile` 以及全精度時區日期區間查詢。","locale":"zh-TW"},"90":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Burni 使用 AEGIS Touchstone Basic-R4-Server 嚴格測試，展現 100% 的規格相容性：","locale":"zh-TW"},"91":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"測試結果：","locale":"zh-TW"},"92":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 18 (2,216 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"93":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 14 (1,948 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"94":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","type":"page","content":"v2 到 v3 遷移指南預覽 (Migration Preview)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v3 (Preview)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","locale":"zh-TW"},"95":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview","content":"從 Burni v2.8 升級至 v3 的注意事項、環境需求、雙資料庫與時序資料平滑遷移步驟","locale":"zh-TW"},"96":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/migration-preview-