:"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#時序與雙資料庫架構解析","content":"在大型醫療資訊系統（HIS）與健康資料交換平台中，FHIR 伺服器的資料量往往呈指數級成長。尤其是依據 FHIR 規範，所有資源修改與刪除操作都必須寫入歷史版本，歷史版本資料量往往是當前資源的數倍至數十倍。","locale":"zh-TW"},"160":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#時序與雙資料庫架構解析","content":"**Burni v3** 採用了創新的 **Temporal & Dual Database 架構**，從根本上解決了大量歷史資料引發的資料庫膨脹與查詢延遲問題。","locale":"zh-TW"},"161":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"**Primary DB（活躍資源資料庫）**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"162":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"僅存放最新的 Active 資源版本。","locale":"zh-TW"},"163":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"資料庫容量精簡，索引可常駐記憶體（Working Set），大幅提升日常臨床檢索與 RESTful API 的回應速度。","locale":"zh-TW"},"164":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"**Temporal DB（時序歷史資料庫）**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"165":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"存放所有資源的歷史修訂版（`_history` 集合）、HTTP 請求關聯紀錄與 Provenance 審計資料。","locale":"zh-TW"},"166":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"針對時間序列（Timestamp）、版本編號（`versionId`）進行複合索引優化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"167":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"在 v3 中，針對資源更新的歷史歸檔流程進行了精準強化：","locale":"zh-TW"},"168":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"**BundleRequest Provenance 保全**：確保在交易（Transaction）與批次操作下，每個版本都能完整對應到發起請求的 HTTP 標頭與使用者識別。","locale":"zh-TW"},"169":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"**vread 操作精確回溯**：即便資源已經過多次更新或甚至邏輯刪除，客戶端依舊能透過 `[baseUrl]/[type]/[id]/_history/[vid]` 快速且零延遲地從 Temporal DB 讀取當時的快照。","locale":"zh-TW"},"170":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"**分級儲存 (Tiered Storage)**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"171":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"Primary DB 可配置高 IOPS 的 NVMe SSD，Temporal DB 則可配置具備成本效益的大容量儲存媒體，大幅節約雲端基礎設施成本。","locale":"zh-TW"},"172":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"**獨立備份策略**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"173":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"活躍資料庫與歷史資料庫可採用不同的快照與備份排程，提高容災復原（Disaster Recovery）的彈性。","locale":"zh-TW"},"174":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"**無縫切換**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"175":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#營運與維護優勢","content":"Burni v3 核心提供了透明的 Data Operator 層，對上層業務邏輯與外掛模組保持完全透明，無需更改現有 API 呼叫方式。","locale":"zh-TW"},"176":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","type":"page","content":"產生OpenAPI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","FHIR API 文件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","locale":"zh-TW"},"177":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api#產生-openapi","content":"產生 OpenAPI","locale":"zh-TW"},"178":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api#如何產生","content":"如何產生","locale":"zh-TW"},"179":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api#產生-openapi","content":"Burni 使用 apidoc 以及在`config/config.js`檔案設定的Resources 產生 OpenAPI 文件。並使用ReDoc作為API文件的網站.","locale":"zh-TW"},"180":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-open-api-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/fhir-api-documentation/generate-ope